{"articleNo":"659","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_03.do?mode=view&articleNo=659&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2009학년도 신입생 입학식 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2009.02.23","hit":"16059","attachments":[],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\"><strong>[2009학년도 신입생 입학식 안내]</strong></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\"><br></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\">우리대학교 2009학년도 신입생 입학식이 아래와 같이 거행됨을 알려드립니다.</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\"><br></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\">□ 일&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 시 : 2009. 3. 2(월) 11:00</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\">□ 장&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 소 : 체육관</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\">□ 참석대상</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 학부 신입생</font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\">&nbsp;&nbsp;- 최고경영관리자과정 입학생</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\"><br></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 18.3pt; TEXT-INDENT: -18.3pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\">☞ </font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\">신입생은 10:40까지 체육관 안으로 입장하여 지정된 위치에 정렬</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\">하시기 바랍니다.</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\"><br></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 20.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -20.7pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\">☞ 학부 신입생은 입학식 직후 학부별로 수강신청 오리엔테이션을 실시하므로&nbsp; 입학식에 참석해야 합니다.</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\"><br></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 20.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -20.7pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\">☞ 편입생은 14:00에 글로벌관 B109호에서 실시하는 오리엔테이션에 바로 참석하시기 바랍니다.</font></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\"><br></font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-LEFT: 20.7pt; TEXT-INDENT: -20.7pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\">※ 오리엔테이션 장소 </font></span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\">\n</p><table style=\"BORDER-TOP-STYLE: none; BORDER-RIGHT-STYLE: none; BORDER-LEFT-STYLE: none; BORDER-COLLAPSE: collapse; BORDER-BOTTOM-STYLE: none\" cellspacing=\"0\" cellpadding=\"0\" border=\"1\">\n    <tbody>\n        <tr>\n            <td style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: #000000 0.4pt solid; PADDING-RIGHT: 1.4pt; BORDER-TOP: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-LEFT: 1.4pt; PADDING-BOTTOM: 1.4pt; BORDER-LEFT: #000000 1.1pt solid; PADDING-TOP: 1.4pt; BORDER-BOTTOM: #000000 1.1pt solid\" valign=\"middle\" width=\"87\" bgcolor=\"#f1f1f1\" height=\"24\">\n            <p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 10pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 160%; FONT-FAMILY: 굴림\"><font face=\"굴림\">구분</font></span></p>\n            </td>\n            <